WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.406
The advertising exchange for the agentic internet.

00:00:10.406 --> 00:00:17.792
Three advertisers ready. Add a fourth.

00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:22.890
Tab fills an editable suggestion.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:30.019
Give Jev the offer, capabilities and buying context.

00:00:30.019 --> 00:00:36.118
Approve the exact Sponsored card.

00:00:36.118 --> 00:00:42.218
Maximum bid. Campaign cap. Test-USDC deposit.

00:00:42.218 --> 00:01:10.169
Fund a Solana Devnet payment channel.

00:01:10.169 --> 00:01:29.428
A fresh organic answer from the example DeepSeek chat app.

00:01:29.428 --> 00:01:34.515
Only eligible, funded campaigns participate.

00:01:34.515 --> 00:01:46.672
ContextHint evidence and advertiser hints inform Jev’s judgments.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:52.762
The exchange selects the highest eligible bid.

00:01:52.762 --> 00:02:04.122
A signed delivery receipt creates one charge.

00:02:04.122 --> 00:02:11.268
Cumulative authorization through the Solana payment channel.

00:02:11.268 --> 00:02:18.364
The accepted delivery appears in the advertiser dashboard.

00:02:18.364 --> 00:02:34.314
Close the channel: publisher payout and unused-deposit refund.

00:02:34.314 --> 00:02:41.188
ContextHint intelligence. Jev decisions. Solana payment channels.
